tddlog

The source code of tddlog is licensed under the Apache License 2.0
(LICENSE). The repository also holds copies of third-party programs and
data, under their own terms:

- tests/problog: programs from ProbLog's system test suite
  (https://github.com/ML-KULeuven/problog, test/*.pl), Apache License 2.0.
- tests/dice/caesar-recur.dice and tests/dice/recursion.dice: programs
  from Dice (https://github.com/SHoltzen/dice, commit 0ea228e,
  resources/), Apache License 2.0. The other programs there were written
  for tddlog.
- examples/asia.net and examples/cancer.net: two Bayesian networks
  written out from their publications (Lauritzen and Spiegelhalter, 1988;
  Korb and Nicholson, 2004), under the Apache License 2.0 with the rest.

The benchmarks' other Bayesian networks, of the bnlearn repository
(https://www.bnlearn.com/bnrepository/), are not in the repository, as no
license for redistributing them is established: data/fetch.txt names
where each is downloaded (ProbLog's copies, and bnlearn for munin1 to
munin4) and its SHA-256.

Each directory's README gives the source and commit of its files. The
repository's baselines branch holds further copies, listed in its NOTICE.
